OL,3,AFrance promises 3,000 extra teachers in
OL,4,Afirst step to calm student protests
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe French government has made its
OL,7,Ffirst sign of giving ground to teenage
OL,8,Fprotesters, with a promise of 3,000
OL,9,Fextra supply teachers in the coming
OL,10,Fdays.
OL,12,FEducation minister Edouard Geffray made
OL,13,Fthe offer in a television interview on
OL,14,FThursday evening, at the end of another
OL,15,Fday of sometimes violent demonstrations
OL,16,Fby high-school students.
OL,18,FThe government says 6,877 people have
OL,19,Fbeen arrested, 86% of whom are under
OL,20,Fthe age of 18, since protests began
OL,21,Fcentred around demands for more
OL,22,Fresources in secondary education.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
